[{"id":3519493045,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7RxzO1","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","login":"Calinou","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou"},"body":"Tested locally, it works as expected. Code looks good to me.\r\n\r\nFrom an UX perspective, I suggest fading out the icons of individual nodes a little, like we do in the input map editor for input events for each action:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"555\" height=\"206\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/65165d3d-792b-4fe5-ae2c-f8a06eb9ee37\" />\r\n\r\nNotice how the trash icon is slightly less opaque for individual events compared to the action above it. This helps distinguish long lists of icons and making sure you click the icon you actually meant to click when the icon is far away from the text.\r\n\r\nSomething like this:\r\n\r\nBefore | After (mockup)\r\n-|-\r\n<img width=\"269\" height=\"105\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8a40a410-cb9d-4a3b-a5d8-c77093f3236a\" /> | <img width=\"269\" height=\"105\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2150426a-8b66-452a-a25e-52f67bdb7203\" />","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110866#pullrequestreview-3519493045","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/110866","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-11-28T16:26:03Z"},{"id":3530912284,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7SdXIc","state":"APPROVED","commit_id":"ebf6016267e4383438f56e001cbe1cfa978d2491","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z"